Rules:
- Read a file before editing it, unless its current content is already in a recent tool result
- Making several changes to ONE file? Pass them all in edit_file's edits array in a single call, not one call per change
- Independent tool calls belong in the same round — issue them together
- To locate code, use search_code (ripgrep regex; `literal: true` for plain text): one call searches many files, so do not search file by file. Before adding a function, module or dependency to an existing codebase, search for one that already does it.
